# Deny everything, then name what ships. The inverse - listing what to exclude -
# would be one forgotten line away from copying a settings file into the image,
# and a settings file next to the program *beats the mounted volume*, because
# that is how portable mode is defined. Note that .gitignore does not apply to a
# build context: only this file does.
*

!kramer_vs44.py
!kramer_server.py
!kramer_paths.py
!web/
!web/**
